a Course Service để lấy đề + đáp án.&lt;br&gt;• Sơ đồ tổng quan &amp;amp; ma trận role: &lt;i&gt;../uc-overview.drawio&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;../uc-overview-by-role.drawio&lt;/i&gt;." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="702" width="1300" height="132" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>